{"t":"RL","n":"Ralph Lauren Corporation","nKo":"랄프 로렌","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":385.29,"chg":18.64,"chgPct":0.05084,"prev":366.65,"dayH":388.77,"dayL":375.33,"w52H":421.6,"w52L":317.23,"vol":580991,"avgVol":603780,"mcap":22771298304,"pe":22.12,"fpe":18.17,"eps":17.42,"feps":21.2,"pb":8.34,"div":4.0,"divY":0.0104,"beta":1.3,"short":2265029,"shortPct":0.0703,"shortRatio":4.54,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Consumer Cyclical","sKo":"소비자 경기순환","i":"Apparel Manufacturing","iKo":"의류 제조","city":"New York","emp":15600,"web":"https://www.ralphlauren.com","sum":"Ralph Lauren Corporation designs, markets, and distributes lifestyle products in North America, Europe, Asia, and internationally. The company offers apparel, including a range of men's, women's, and children's clothing; footwear and accessories, which comprise casual shoes, dress shoes, boots, sneakers, sandals, eyewear, watches, fashion and fine jewelry, scarves, hats, gloves, and umbrellas, as well as leather goods comprising handbags, luggage, small leather goods, and belts; home products, such as bed and bath lines, furniture, fabric and wall coverings, lighting, dining, floor coverings, decorative accessories, and giftware; and fragrances. The company sells apparel and accessories under the Ralph Lauren Collection, Ralph Lauren Purple Label, Polo Ralph Lauren, Double RL, Lauren Ralph","sumKo":"Ralph Lauren Corporation은 북미, 유럽, 아시아 및 전 세계에서 라이프스타일 제품을 디자인, 마케팅 및 유통합니다. 이 회사는 다양한 남성복, 여성복, 아동복을 포함한 의류를 제공합니다. 캐주얼 신발, 정장 구두, 부츠, 운동화, 샌들, 안경, 시계, 패션 및 고급 주얼리, 스카프, 모자, 장갑 및 우산으로 구성된 신발 및 액세서리와 핸드백, 수하물, 소형 가죽 제품 및 벨트로 구성된 가죽 제품; 침대 및 욕실 라인, 가구, 직물 및 벽 덮개, 조명, 식당, 바닥 덮개, 장식 액세서리 및 선물용품과 같은 가정용품; 그리고 향수. 이 회사는 Ralph Lauren Collection, Ralph Lauren Purple Label, Polo Ralph Lauren, Double RL, Lauren Ralph로 의류 및 액세서리를 판매합니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2023,"rev":6443600000,"ni":522700000},{"y":2024,"rev":6631400000,"ni":646300000},{"y":2025,"rev":7079000000,"ni":742900000},{"y":2026,"rev":8114500000,"ni":941